# NOTE: sitemap.xml was listed here as "build output that is regenerated by
# build_site.mjs", which is true but was also why the deployed site had no
# sitemap — GitHub Pages serves only what is committed, and nothing ever wrote
# the file besides a local build. It is generated on every run like the HTML, and
# it is committed like the HTML, because it is a deployed artifact rather than an
# intermediate. See README "Rebuild".

